Description: Fix workspace manager desktop entry categories
 The desktop entry accidentally prefixes the Categories key twice and misses
 the final category-list semicolon. Fix it so desktop menu parsers see the
 application as a settings/desktop-settings entry.
Author: Reaper <JohnGrimmReaper@disroot.org>
Forwarded: https://github.com/NsCDE/NsCDE/pull/224
Last-Update: 2026-06-15

--- a/xdg/applications/nscde-wspgmgr.desktop
+++ b/xdg/applications/nscde-wspgmgr.desktop
@@ -8 +8 @@
-Categories=Categories=Settings;DesktopSettings
+Categories=Settings;DesktopSettings;
